--- code
export function interpretPeriodBlindAnswer(clearing: Clearing, ask: (house: string) => boolean): LedgerClaim {
  return claimFromPeriodBlindYes(clearing, getClearingIdentifiers(clearing).some(ask));
}
--- facts
Reads an answer given without a period and turns it into a claim about the clearing house.
